{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-proton","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:categorical-proton","kind":"definition","title":"Proton (categorical)","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-down-quark"],"cites":["references/leitner2026"],"tags":["proton","hadron","baryon","color-tube","knot","categorical"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton","text":"categorical-proton.md","leanSource":"categorical-proton.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:categorical-proton\"></a><p><em>The <strong>proton</strong> is the baryon governed by the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2 + 1</code> crossing partition: two up quarks (positive orientation) and one down quark (negative orientation) bound within the Borromean braid <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{B}_3</code>.</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathfrak{p} = \\mathcal{B}_3(\\mathfrak{u},\\mathfrak{u},\\mathfrak{d})</code></pre>\n<p><em>where:</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{B}_3 = (\\sigma_0\\sigma_1^{-1})^3</code> is the Borromean braid of three unknots threaded through color tubes <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(r,g,b)</code>. Two unknots bear positive crossing orientation (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{u}</code>) and one bears negative orientation (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{d}</code>).</em></li>\n</ul>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.md","heading":"Definition","number":"9.3.2","page":"b/def-categorical-proton","qa":{"counts":{"pass":81,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":65},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.LiftingDescent.Torsion.CategoricalProton","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
